      "type": "text",
      "text": "const struct file_operations\next4_file_operations\n\nread_iter   ext4_file_read_iter\nwrite_iter  ext4_file_write_iter\nopen        ext4_file_open\nrelease     ext4_release_file\nget_unmapped_area   empty",
